  "description": "An exiled tutor and the ice-cold Duke of the North. \n\nA romance blossoming at the tail end of a bitter winter. \n\nJeanne, the daughter of a ruined noble family, became a tutor just to make ends meet. But after simply giving her student a piece of progressive literature, she finds herself banished to the frigid Northern Duchy.\n\nThe master of this domain is Duke Baldur, a man ruling over the desolate North while raising his late brother’s child all on his own.\n\nHe puts Jeanne to the test to see if she’s fit to be his niece’s tutor… But he slowly finds himself captivated by her unwavering spirit and righteous nature.\n\nIn a heart frozen solid by the bitter winter, the first buds of spring finally begin to sprout.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/6400000001)",
